This is the input deck from the tarball provided by Zhi Yue (dated 12/19/2022).
The input script in.txt (adapted from md_cont.inp) reads in the restart file md.restart,
includes the necessary parameter files in the present folder.

Command-line example:

```
mpirun -np 8 ../../../build-raptor/lmp -in in.txt
```

If LAMMPS is built with the GPU package, use the following command to run with GPU acceleration

```
mpirun -np 8 ../../../build-raptor/lmp -in in.txt -sf gpu -pk gpu 2 neigh no pair/only yes tpa 16
```

which means to use 2 GPUs on a compute node, build the neighbor list on the CPU,
and compute the pair forces on the GPU (leaving KSpace on the CPU). For multiple MPI procs
sharing a GPU like this, it is recommended to enable CUDA MPS before the run.




 
